n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"><span>Does it need JavaScript?</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"\n      ><p>No. Only data-type=\"single\" adds a small handler that closes the siblings.</p></div\n    >\n  </details>\n</div>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Multi-open","html":"<div class=\"accordion\" style=\"max-width: 28rem; width: 100%\">\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\" open>\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\">\n      <span>Is it accessible?</span>\n      <svg\n        class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        width=\"16\"\n        height=\"16\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        stroke=\"currentColor\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\"\n      >\n        <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p\n        >Yes. It uses native HTML details/summary elements which are fully accessible by default. Screen reader and\n        keyboard support are built in.</p\n      >\n    </div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\" open>\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\">\n      <span>Is it styled?</span>\n      <svg\n        class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        width=\"16\"\n        height=\"16\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        stroke=\"currentColor\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\"\n      >\n        <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p>Yes. It follows the shadcn/ui token system for consistent theming across light and dark modes.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\">\n      <span>Is it animated?</span>\n      <svg\n        class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        width=\"16\"\n        height=\"16\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        stroke=\"currentColor\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\"\n      >\n        <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p\n        >Yes. Uses <code>::details-content</code> with <code>calc-size(auto, size)</code> for smooth height animation.\n        The chevron rotates via CSS transition.</p\n      >\n    </div>\n  </details>\n</div>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Single-open","html":"<div class=\"accordion\" data-type=\"single\" style=\"max-width: 28rem; width: 100%\">\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\" open>\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\">\n      <span>What payment methods do you accept?</span>\n      <svg\n        class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        width=\"16\"\n        height=\"16\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        stroke=\"currentColor\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\"\n      >\n        <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p>We accept all major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, AmEx), PayPal, and bank transfers for annual plans.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\">\n      <span>Can I cancel my subscription?</span>\n      <svg\n        class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        width=\"16\"\n        height=\"16\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        stroke=\"currentColor\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\"\n      >\n        <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p\n        >Yes, you can cancel at any time from your account settings. Your access continues until the end of the current\n        billing period.</p\n      >\n    </div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\">\n      <span>Do you offer team pricing?</span>\n      <svg\n        class=\"accordion-chevron\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        width=\"16\"\n        height=\"16\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        stroke=\"currentColor\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\"\n      >\n        <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p\n        >Yes. Teams of 5 or more get a 20% discount. Contact our sales team for custom enterprise plans with dedicated\n        support.</p\n      >\n    </div>\n  </details>\n</div>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Custom colors","html":"<div class=\"accordion\" data-variant=\"separated\" data-marker=\"arrow\" style=\"max-width: 28rem; width: 100%\">\n  <details\n    class=\"accordion-item\"\n    open\n    style=\"background: oklch(0.93 0.06 190); color: oklch(0.32 0.08 200); border-color: oklch(0.8 0.08 190)\"\n  >\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"><span>Teal</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>Two declarations color the whole item.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details\n    class=\"accordion-item\"\n    style=\"background: oklch(0.95 0.07 85); color: oklch(0.4 0.09 60); border-color: oklch(0.85 0.1 80)\"\n  >\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"><span>Amber</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>Any palette works - the marker and text mix from the item color.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details\n    class=\"accordion-item\"\n    style=\"background: linear-gradient(120deg, oklch(0.55 0.22 300), oklch(0.6 0.2 350)); color: white; border: 0\"\n  >\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"><span>Gradient</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>Even a gradient surface.</p></div>\n  </details>\n</div>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Icons and emojis","html":"<div class=\"accordion\" data-variant=\"separated\" data-marker=\"arrow\" style=\"max-width: 28rem; width: 100%\">\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\" open>\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n      ><span class=\"accordion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i data-lucide=\"shield-check\"></i></span\n      ><span>Security</span></summary\n    >\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>Two-factor authentication and sessions.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n      ><span class=\"accordion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i data-lucide=\"credit-card\"></i></span\n      ><span>Billing</span></summary\n    >\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>Plan, invoices and payment methods.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n      ><span class=\"accordion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎨</span><span>Appearance</span></summary\n    >\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>Theme, density and fonts.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n      ><span class=\"accordion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔔</span><span>Notifications</span></summary\n    >\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>Email, push and in-app.</p></div>\n  </details>\n</div>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Custom open/close signs","html":"<div class=\"accordion\" data-variant=\"bordered\" style=\"max-width: 28rem; width: 100%\">\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\" open>\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n      ><span>Quarter turn</span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\" class=\"accordion-chevron\" data-turn=\"quarter\"></i\n    ></summary>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>A chevron-right that turns down when open.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n      ><span class=\"accordion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        ><span class=\"accordion-when-closed\">📁</span><span class=\"accordion-when-open\">📂</span></span\n      ><span>Projects</span></summary\n    >\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>The folder opens with the panel.</p></div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n      ><span>Release notes</span><span class=\"accordion-when-closed text-sm\">Show</span\n      ><span class=\"accordion-when-open text-sm\">Hide</span></summary\n    >\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>Words instead of an icon.</p></div>\n  </details>\n</div>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Right to left","html":"<div dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 28rem\">\n  <div class=\"accordion\" data-variant=\"separated\" data-marker=\"arrow\" style=\"width: 100%\">\n    <details class=\"accordion-item\" open>\n      <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n        ><span class=\"accordion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i data-lucide=\"shield-check\"></i></span\n        ><span>الأمان</span></summary\n      >\n      <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>المصادقة الثنائية والجلسات النشطة.</p></div>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n      <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"\n        ><span class=\"accordion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎨</span><span>المظهر</span></summary\n      >\n      <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>السمة والكثافة والخطوط.</p></div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Surfaces","html":"<div class=\"grid gap-6\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); width: 100%\">\n  <div class=\"accordion\" data-variant=\"bordered\" data-marker=\"arrow\" style=\"width: 100%\">\n    <details class=\"accordion-item\" open>\n      <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"><span>Is it accessible?</span></summary>\n      <div class=\"accordion-content\"\n        ><p>Yes - native details/summary: keyboard and screen readers work out of the box.</p></div\n      >\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n      <summary class=\"accordion-trigger\"><span>Is it styled?</span></summary>\n      <div class=\"accordion-content\"><p>It 